  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>此資源包為<span style=\"color:#0cf\"><a style=\"color:#0cf\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/enhanced-audio\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">[點擊] </span><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"color:#36f\">Enhanced Audio</span></span></span></a></span>的選用附加包。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>但也可以疊加在其他資源包上方或單獨使用，全看您的喜好。</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/oHmJeC4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"346\" height=\"221\"></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#339;font-size:14px\"><strong>建議將此資源包置於所有其他資源包之上，以確保音效正常運作。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b;font-size:14px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:14px\">支援版本從 1.14 一直到最新的 26.x.x。</span></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"color:#339;font-size:14px\"><strong><span><span><iframe style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/jRFoHBu0LqM?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;color:#000\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">資訊</span><br>此類資源包能透過玩家行走的地面材質與實體，為 Minecraft 加入環境音效。但當音效數量過多時可能產生異常，因此我將專注於環境音效部分。<br></span></p>",
